        "id": 5255
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-03T18:42:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was just thinking they might want to be able to call `isFormat` or `makeFromStream`. Just an idea, though. Totally fine with this just being a refactor!\n\nAnd even the `id` - I think it\u0027s a nice feature, but doesn\u0027t need to be included here. (I just thought of it because it seems like a natural extension.)",
      "parentUuid": "a3be4aa5_5ff632e6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1033,
        "startChar": 5,
